{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/dPkUq7Zz3sJYqPlTZFBjmQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:58.586631+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/dPkUq7Zz3sJYqPlTZFBjmQ","html":"<div><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ufkmz2ibR8w5MSVIs34C2euF03FB9lZO8NmWampY8wDfmPibejXJibtGVQGSnIgiavgCSab6HvFIvpkU0T7GzvF3Ug/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><em><strong><span>古脊椎所第十三届</span></strong></em></p><p><em><strong><span>大学生夏令营</span></strong></em></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><em><span>//</span></em></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ufkmz2ibR8w5MSVIs34C2euF03FB9lZO8flhppe1yqwMicTb0UlyOgiabhYezIicJJL7PNriaVFc5icS5hGtRtRgqibmQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><em><span> 走进北京</span></em></strong></p></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ufkmz2ibR8w5MSVIs34C2euF03FB9lZO8oVoXhXnJJZvUBa9YP0rrMiceWv65svUicOhTPlXdI19SBBWKwMVjoYcA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span>中国科学院古脊椎动物与古人类研究所（简称“古脊椎所”）是我国目前唯一专门从事古脊椎动物学、古人类学及相关生物地层学研究的学术机构。科研水平在国内本学科领域处于领先位置，若干分支学科在国际古生物学前沿领域处于领先地位。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>古脊椎所大学生夏令营的前身是古脊椎所和台湾《科学月刊》杂志社联合举办的海峡两岸大学生夏令营，从2001年起已经在辽宁朝阳、山东莱阳、甘肃和政、河北泥河湾、云南曲靖、北京等地陆续举办了十二届。本届继续在北京举办。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>为贯彻中国科学院、教育部“科教结合协同育人行动计划”，促进优秀大学生之间的专业交流，激发大学生对古生物学和地层学的认知和科学研究的兴趣，增进优秀大学生对古脊椎所的了解，选拔优秀学生继续深造，古脊椎所将在七月下旬在北京举办“走进北京——古脊椎所第十三届大学生夏令营”，欢迎报名参加。</span></p></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ufkmz2ibR8w5MSVIs34C2euF03FB9lZO8oVoXhXnJJZvUBa9YP0rrMiceWv65svUicOhTPlXdI19SBBWKwMVjoYcA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营通知（第二轮）</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ufkmz2ibR8w5MSVIs34C2euF03FB9lZO8Q1N6tqVPjjHIG7kd4WyznaicwMpGSCMdHbl5awn80PJSCnUtpIIGiafg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营时间及活动内容</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>-</span><span><span>-NO.1--</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>7月20-23日。</span></strong></span></p><p><span>内容包括：开营仪式，联欢活动，知识竞赛，相关领域前沿讲座、专题讲座，相关遗址、博物馆参观，与科学家交流座谈（野外安排可视天气及其他因素调整）等等。 </span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ufkmz2ibR8w5MSVIs34C2euF03FB9lZO8Q1N6tqVPjjHIG7kd4WyznaicwMpGSCMdHbl5awn80PJSCnUtpIIGiafg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>招收对象及规模</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>-</span><span><span>-NO.2--</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>计划招收营员40名。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>招募对象：拥护中国共产党的领导，品行优良，遵纪守法，身心健康；地质学、生物学、地理学、考古学背景的本科三年级在校学生；学习成绩优秀，思维活跃，对科研工作具有浓厚的兴趣，有志从事古生物学、考古学研究。有意报考我所的2026届本科生优先；在学期间成绩优秀、获得推免资格者优先。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ufkmz2ibR8w5MSVIs34C2euF03FB9lZO8Q1N6tqVPjjHIG7kd4WyznaicwMpGSCMdHbl5awn80PJSCnUtpIIGiafg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申报流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>-</span><span><span>-NO.3--</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>通过中国科学院大学夏令营网报系统申报。请申请人注册登录“科教结合协同育人行动计划”网站（http://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/），点击大学生夏令营报名。承办夏令营单位选择古脊椎动物与古人类研究所（代码80054）。可在网上申请表“备注”栏注明自己感兴趣或有意愿从事的具体方向（科学技术史科技考古方向请关注国科大人文学院夏令营）。填报时请仔细阅读系统首页的“填报说明”和“常见问题解答”。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span><strong><span>网上报名截止时间为6月30日。</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ufkmz2ibR8w5MSVIs34C2euF03FB9lZO8Q1N6tqVPjjHIG7kd4WyznaicwMpGSCMdHbl5awn80PJSCnUtpIIGiafg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>提交材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>-</span><span><span>-NO.4--</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 中国科学院大学2025年大学生暑期夏令营申请表（系统生成，本人签名，所在学院盖章扫描件）；</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>2. 个人身份证明材料（扫描身份证正/反面、学生证里/外面）；</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>3. 本科成绩单和专业排名证明（成绩单加盖教务处公章，专业排名加盖教务处或院系公章，扫描件）；</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>4. 英语水平证明（如四/六级，雅思托福成绩等，扫描件或官网截图）；其他能力证明（已发表论文、专利、各类证书等，扫描件）。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>5. 推荐信两份，一份来自班主任或辅导员，另一份为任课老师（推荐老师签名，扫描件）。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>请将上述材料电子版按以上顺序整合为一个PDF文件，发送到研究生部邮箱yjs@ivpp.ac.cn；文件名为本科学校名称-专业-姓名）。</span></p><p><span><strong><span>截止日期6月30日。</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ufkmz2ibR8w5MSVIs34C2euF03FB9lZO8Q1N6tqVPjjHIG7kd4WyznaicwMpGSCMdHbl5awn80PJSCnUtpIIGiafg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>资格审核和信息确认</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>-</span><span><span>-NO.5--</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>材料如有不实将取消入营资格并将情况通报学生所在学校。组委会将从报名者中择优选取。</span><span><strong><span>资格审核拟于7月1日完成</span></strong></span><span>，申请者可通过报名系统查询是否通过。未入选者不再另行通知。</span><span><strong><span>通过审核者须在7月6日前登录报名系统选择确定是否同意参加，逾期将视为自动放弃。</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ufkmz2ibR8w5MSVIs34C2euF03FB9lZO8Q1N6tqVPjjHIG7kd4WyznaicwMpGSCMdHbl5awn80PJSCnUtpIIGiafg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>费用及管理</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>-</span><span><span>-NO.6--</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 我所为营员提供夏令营期间的食宿及相关活动资助，不另收费。提前到达及延后离开产生的费用由营员本人负责。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>2. 营员报到后要求全程参加夏令营各项活动，营员应遵守我所有关规定和夏令营统一安排，否则将被取消营员资格，且不能享受营员待遇。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>3. 要求营员身体健康，患先天疾病、心脏病或哮喘等突发病者不能参加；运动禁忌类疾病患者及患病未康复者不能参加。</span></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>4. 夏令营期间营员安全由营员本人及学籍所在学校负责。我所为营员购买夏令营期间的短期意外伤害保险，发生的医疗费用及因个人行为导致的意外事故，由保险公司及营员本人承担。营员报到时签署安全协议。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ufkmz2ibR8w5MSVIs34C2euF03FB9lZO88ecDEfHEuzEy7jTXYPpyJ9Sa6TIAj2Z04bG8N8K6C4XpvvnxzVjplQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ufkmz2ibR8w5MSVIs34C2euF03FB9lZO8flhppe1yqwMicTb0UlyOgiabhYezIicJJL7PNriaVFc5icS5hGtRtRgqibmQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><sect